WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:10.456
One day a young bird was learning to fly.

2
00:00:10.457 --> 00:00:15.999
"Whee! This is fun!" he said, flapping his wings.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.349
Suddenly another bird flew by.

4
00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:25.140
"Wow! What kind of bird was that?" he wondered.

5
00:00:25.141 --> 00:00:27.116
"How cool!"

6
00:00:27.117 --> 00:00:30.654
He decided to follow the other bird.

7
00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:35.095
On his way he met a squirrel.

8
00:00:35.096 --> 00:00:39.670
"Hey, Squirrel," he said, "did you see a bird go by?"

9
00:00:39.671 --> 00:00:42.197
The squirrel was confused.

10
00:00:42.198 --> 00:00:44.830
"What bird?" he said.

11
00:00:44.831 --> 00:00:48.325
"Just a moment ago, a bird flew by us.

12
00:00:48.326 --> 00:00:51.512
Didn't you see it?" the bird asked again.

13
00:00:51.513 --> 00:00:53.673
The squirrel smiled.

14
00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:58.581
"Oh, that was not a bird. That was me!"

15
00:00:58.582 --> 00:01:03.634
"You?" said the bird. "But you are a squirrel!

16
00:01:03.635 --> 00:01:07.256
Squirrels cannot fly!"

17
00:01:07.257 --> 00:01:10.064
"Well, I can," said the squirrel.

18
00:01:10.065 --> 00:01:13.363
"I am a flying squirrel! Watch me!"

19
00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:16.195
The squirrel jumped off the branch.

20
00:01:16.196 --> 00:01:21.465
He stretched his arms and legs, and soared through the air.

21
00:01:21.466 --> 00:01:26.216
"Oh, that was awesome!" the little bird said.

22
00:01:26.217 --> 00:01:30.206
"But your wings do not look like my wings."

23
00:01:30.207 --> 00:01:33.469
"No," explained the flying squirrel.

24
00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:34.971
"I do not have wings.

25
00:01:34.972 --> 00:01:37.286
I have flaps of skin on my sides.

26
00:01:37.287 --> 00:01:40.702
I stretch these flaps and I can glide for a long time.

27
00:01:40.703 --> 00:01:44.792
Now you know flying is not just for birds!"

28
00:01:44.793 --> 00:01:48.436
Just then an insect flew by.

29
00:01:48.437 --> 00:01:53.607
"Oh, my favorite kind of insect!" said the bird.

30
00:01:53.608 --> 00:01:57.881
"Oh, that is my favorite too!" the squirrel agreed.

31
00:01:57.882 --> 00:02:03.206
The squirrel and the bird followed the insect to the stream.

32
00:02:03.207 --> 00:02:08.354
Suddenly a fish flew out of the water and glided by them.

33
00:02:08.355 --> 00:02:11.918
"What was that? Did you see it?" asked the squirrel.

34
00:02:11.919 --> 00:02:16.328
"I cannot believe what I saw!" said the bird.

35
00:02:16.329 --> 00:02:19.245
"Fish cannot fly!"

36
00:02:19.246 --> 00:02:21.853
The fish swam up to them.

37
00:02:21.854 --> 00:02:24.450
"You are right!" the fish said.

38
00:02:24.451 --> 00:02:28.230
"But I can. I am a flying fish.

39
00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:31.960
I can glide through the air when a bigger fish tries to eat me.

40
00:02:31.961 --> 00:02:34.557
I have to go now. Bye!"

41
00:02:34.558 --> 00:02:37.578
And the fish swam away.

42
00:02:37.579 --> 00:02:43.425
"Gee! I have never seen a fish fly before," said the bird.

43
00:02:43.426 --> 00:02:45.958
"Well, Squirrel, you were right!

44
00:02:45.959 --> 00:02:50.380
I guess flying really isn't just for birds."

45
00:02:50.381 --> 00:02:53.370
"Good-bye, Bird," said the squirrel.

46
00:02:53.371 --> 00:02:56.113
"I have to tell my family about the flying fish!"

47
00:02:56.114 --> 00:02:58.736
He leaped into the air.

48
00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.540
"Good-bye!" said the bird.

49
00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:04.403
"I have to tell my mom about this.

50
00:03:04.404 --> 00:03:08.061
You never know what might fly by!"
